580
00:50:32,880 --> 00:50:34,780
The slightest jolt, it could crumble.

581
00:50:34,880 --> 00:50:36,061
How long?

582
00:50:54,520 --> 00:50:55,781
You all right, honey?

583
00:50:59,160 --> 00:51:00,785
Yeah, I'm fine.

584
00:51:16,880 --> 00:51:18,020
Hi, this is Paul.

585
00:51:18,120 --> 00:51:20,507
Leave a message
