597
00:52:16,920 --> 00:52:18,226
Hey, going north?

598
00:52:18,760 --> 00:52:19,780
Yeah, I am, actually.

599
00:52:19,880 --> 00:52:21,580
Okay, I just need a ride
about 12 miles up.

600
00:52:24,320 --> 00:52:26,980
- Well, that's quite a backpack you got there.
- Thanks.

601
00:52:27,080 --> 00:52:29,023
