in the driver's seat of my own life.

674
00:56:23,920 --> 00:56:27,786
I thought there was
so much time, you know?

675
00:56:31,640 --> 00:56:33,310
And just when...

676
00:56:35,200 --> 00:56:37,382
So many things were beginning.

677
00:56:41,960 --> 00:56:43,107
Oh, well!

678
